<title>USA: Unionbancal ups dividend.</title>
<headline>Unionbancal ups dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>UnionBanCal Corp increased its quarterly cash dividend to $0.42 cents a share for the third quarter of 1997, up $0.07 cents, or 20 percent, from the second quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>The dividend will be paid October 3, 1997, to shareholders of record as of September 5, 1997.</p>
